s://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/02/fhyjt4j1a1fichl39d8fjkqqc48jvx1.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%BB%91%E7%BE%BD%E4%B9%8B%E5%8D%B0.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/02/fhyjt4j1a1fichl39d8fjkqqc48jvx1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />黑羽之印\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>造成的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"物理伤害\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"\">物理伤害</font></span></span>]视为[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">魔法伤害</span>]。战斗开始时获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冰铠\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">冰铠</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>回合。在自己当前行动内，当[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]攻击带有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]的目标时，触发[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽千片\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽千片</font></span></span>]，攻击后消耗[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]目标的的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]。主动使用[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]将对目标施加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"冻伤\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">冻伤</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。<br />魔攻值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>附加在物攻值上。行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>格内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]的敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%A6%AE%E8%92%82%E5%A8%85\" title=\"角色图鉴库/妮蒂娅\"><img alt=\"头像 妮蒂娅.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9b/bbr1nam50ur5ezs6v1pllugk3fbrudp.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">妮蒂娅</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>附加在物攻值上。行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>名没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]的敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>附加在物攻值上，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽千片\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽千片</font></span></span>]造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]最大射程增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">5</font>格内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]的敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>魔攻值的<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>附加在物攻值上，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽千片\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽千片</font></span></span>]造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">普攻</span>]最大射程增加<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>格。行动开始时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内最近的<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名没有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]的敌人施加[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"黑羽\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">黑羽</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7cakt